From 28570a12e94af664bfe566b8f44adb204f836465 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: zeroday0619 <escha@zeroday0619.dev>
Date: Mon, 9 Nov 2026 13:08:55 +0900
Subject: [PATCH 8/9] fix: refine pastel contrast against production surfaces

From: Codex <codex@localhost>

Improve muted text on dark raised surfaces and input boundaries on light surfaces. Use consistent pastel selection and informational states. Keep zero-count area layers from painting a misleading line over real traffic and strengthen light-theme chart strokes. Validate the zero-count regression, focused UI suites, custom runtime checks and both themes against production data.
